# 2. Objective

Implement a reusable JSONL adapter:

```text
JSONL File
    ↓
JSONL Dataset Adapter
    ↓
Validation / Mapping
    ↓
Canonical Sample[]
```

It must support:

* fully labelled JSONL
* partially labelled JSONL
* completely unlabelled JSONL
* configurable field names
* explicit sample IDs
* deterministic generated IDs
* optional split fields
* dataset/version metadata

The resulting samples must be indistinguishable from samples loaded through the CSV adapter.

